              "id": "CVE-2022-0987",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "PackageKit: Information Disclosure in Transaction Interface via timing"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in PackageKit in the way some of the methods exposed by the Transaction interface examines files. This issue allows a local user to measure the time the methods take to execute and know whether a file owned by root or other users exists."
